1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,860
integration, making friends. A.

2
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:09,210
Daniel found a story about friends.

3
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:15,130
Read the story with him and answer the questions below.

4
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:18,440
Two friends and the bear.

5
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,710
Two friends were walking in the forest.

6
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:25,510
It was a sunny day and they were happy.

7
00:00:25,510 --> 00:00:29,290
Suddenly they saw a bear coming towards them.

8
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:31,310
They were very scared.

9
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:35,220
One of the friends quickly climbed up a tree.

10
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:38,560
The other tried too, but he failed.

11
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:44,270
He knew he couldn't fight the bear alone, so he lay down on the ground.

12
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:49,520
He thought, the bear will leave me alone if it thinks I'm dead.

13
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:56,500
The bear came close to the friend on the ground and smelt his head, but it didn't attack.

14
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:01,320
After the bear left, the other friend came down from the tree.

15
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:05,490
It looked like the bear said something to you, he said.

16
00:01:05,490 --> 00:01:08,450
Yes, answered the friend on the ground.

17
00:01:08,450 --> 00:01:13,100
It said a true friend should not leave you in times of danger.
